  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_9112.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La nit d&#39;aquest dimecres s&#39;ha celebrat a Artesa, pedania d&#39;Onda, el concurs de paelles. Les penyes i grups d&#39;amistats han anat duent-les al front&oacute;, on se les han menjades. Despr&eacute;s ha hagut bingo, el sorteig del rotllo de Santa Anna i ball amb un pianet.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesfestesartesa13/img_9085.jpg\" alt=\"img_9085\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesfestesartesa13/img_9086.jpg\" alt=\"img_9086\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesfestesartesa13/img_9087.jpg\" alt=\"img_9087\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesfestesartesa13/img_9088.jpg\" alt=\"img_9088\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesfestesartesa13/img_9089.jpg\" alt=\"img_9089\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesfestesartesa13/img_9090.jpg\" alt=\"img_9090\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesfestesartesa13/img_9091.jpg\" alt=\"img_9091\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesfestesartesa13/img_9092.jpg\" alt=\"img_9092\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesfestesartesa13/img_9093.jpg\" alt=\"img_9093\" style=\"